<title>UK: Wilson (Connolly) profit dips, div held.</title>
<headline>Wilson (Connolly) profit dips, div held.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.7		    vs 3.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.36		   vs 1.36</p>
<p> Pretax		     8.04		   vs 10.04</p>
<p> Turnover		   124.19		 vs 107.62</p>
<p> Tax			  2.65		   vs 3.31</p>
<p> Net taxed		  5.39		   vs 6.73</p>
<p> Pay date		   October 25</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 1</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 23</p>
<p> NOTE - House builder Wilson (Connolly) Holdings Plc said current reservations are 20 percent ahead of last year while its sales position has improved by 10 percent.</p>
<p>It said that these factors plus a wider product range will enable the group to produce a stronger profits performance in the second half.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
